WEBVTT

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:40.693
Uh, this is the scene
taking place in Machida...

00:02:40.727 --> 00:02:43.093
...and things are quite chaotic.

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:44.653
Due to the earthquake last night,

00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:46.892
the rate of the building's
collapse has gotten worse,

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:50.664
and at this rate, the entire building is
in danger of being swallowed up...

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:52.364
...by a gigantic hole that is thought
to have been caused...

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:53.838
...by an anomaly in the geography.

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:56.671
This has been Oda reporting.

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:59.946
Big brother, the place
where we used to live has...
What do you think, Mr. Iwasaki?

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:01.072
What do you think, Mr. Iwasaki?

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:04.777
This is an absolute hazard.

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:06.375
I believe this is because
either the repair crew...

00:03:06.419 --> 00:03:08.284
...or the Ministry of Land,
Infrastructure, and Transport...

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:10.619
...have neglected this place.

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:12.625
A quick response
has been requested.

00:03:27.407 --> 00:03:31.639
Don't get involved with us,
not ever again!

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:35.136
But I'll leave the final decision
up to you.

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.671
Of whether you awaken it.

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:38.809
Rokujo...

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:40.011
I've made up my mind.

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:42.410
You're early.

00:03:43.189 --> 00:03:45.020
Good morning.

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:48.516
What in the world brings you into
the office so early, Mr. Always Late?

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:56.129
Mr. Muramasa, there's something
I'd like for you to tell me.

00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:58.899
And what might that be this time?

00:03:58.938 --> 00:04:00.565
It's about the second division.

00:04:00.607 --> 00:04:01.835
The second division?

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:04.775
Why was a second division
established?

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:08.577
As you know, the second division
of the S.M.I.F.,

00:04:08.615 --> 00:04:11.846
also known as Tokko,
does not officially exist.

00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:15.320
But we, the first division,
were put together to succeed those...

00:04:15.355 --> 00:04:17.448
...who were unable to solve the
scattered body part murders case...

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.981
...and lost their lives
in the line of duty.

00:04:20.026 --> 00:04:22.017
It was when there was a lot
of criticism of the police force...

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:24.359
...and we were so bogged down
we couldn't act.

00:04:24.397 --> 00:04:26.331
That's when they appeared.

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:32.170
Officially, the second division,
in other words Tokko...

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:34.366
...was officially established
shortly after that.

00:04:34.407 --> 00:04:37.308
In any case, it seemed like
the culprits had been arrested.

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:42.576
To the mass media, it was
announced that it was drug addicts,

00:04:42.615 --> 00:04:45.948
fighting between gangs,
and abnormal people, but...

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:48.647
You've seen it, right, Shindo?

00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:51.384
What they do to their opponents.

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:57.760
And even now, we still don't know
what it is they're chasing.

00:04:57.797 --> 00:05:02.200
We don't even know what
the Tokko themselves are.

00:05:02.235 --> 00:05:04.726
Well, I guess you could say
that the second division exists...

00:05:04.771 --> 00:05:07.831
...because the first division
is hopeless, but...

00:05:07.874 --> 00:05:11.503
There's no mistaking
that they exist in the shadows,

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:13.842
although we don't know why.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:18.078
Surprisingly, we may be here
to be camouflage.

00:05:18.117 --> 00:05:19.106
What?

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:21.120
Mr. Muramasa...

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:27.319
Um... you see, there is something
that I've just got to know.

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:30.692
You want to know
where they are, right?

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:34.427
What? Yes, I've checked out
various places, but...

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:36.799
I checked the head office
and the Security Section,

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:39.532
but there isn't a group
like theirs anywhere.

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:41.597
Last night,
we received a complaint.

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:43.632
They said that a man by the name
of Shindo from the S.M.I. F...

00:05:43.676 --> 00:05:46.167
...was being unruly at the reception
area of the Security Section.

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:47.839
I'm sorry.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.780
But there is a girl...

00:05:49.816 --> 00:05:52.944
No, someone that I just
have to see, and...

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:55.112
I'm sorry,
but I don't know either.

00:05:55.154 --> 00:05:56.246
What?

00:05:56.289 --> 00:05:58.587
But there is a way
to see the Tokko.

00:05:58.624 --> 00:05:59.955
How?

00:05:59.992 --> 00:06:02.085
You just have to call out
those monsters.

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:07.229
Admittedly, I have no idea
how to do that.

00:06:07.266 --> 00:06:09.325
What's going on, you guys?

00:06:09.369 --> 00:06:12.031
What are you two
whispering about?

00:06:12.071 --> 00:06:13.732
Good morning, Chief.

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:15.331
You're back in the office
starting today, right?

00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:16.364
Yeah.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:21.771
Hey, Shindo.
What in the world were you thinking?

00:06:21.814 --> 00:06:23.611
What? Nothing.

00:06:23.649 --> 00:06:25.139
Nothing, you say?

00:06:25.184 --> 00:06:28.051
Don't mess with me!
There's no hiding it!

00:06:28.087 --> 00:06:30.920
You hooked up with that girl
from Tokko!

00:06:30.957 --> 00:06:32.652
You're dating, right!?

00:06:32.692 --> 00:06:34.592
Y-You've got it wrong!

00:06:36.462 --> 00:06:37.451
This is a big one.

00:06:40.633 --> 00:06:41.622
Shindo!?

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:44.227
Hey, where are you going?
We're still working here!

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.966
This time I'm going
to suspend your ass!

00:06:59.819 --> 00:07:01.286
Hey! This place is off limits!

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:04.289
I'm Shindo
from the Shibuya S.M.I. F!

00:07:04.323 --> 00:07:05.483
I'm going in!

00:07:05.525 --> 00:07:07.254
Shibuya? Hold on!

00:07:09.395 --> 00:07:12.558
Hey, have you seen a bunch
of people carrying swords?

00:07:12.598 --> 00:07:15.226
Swords?
What are you talking about?

00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:17.168
I'm talking about the people
from Tokko...

00:07:17.203 --> 00:07:19.467
...who cut apart the monsters
that came out of this hole.

00:07:19.505 --> 00:07:20.938
Haven't you seen them!?

00:07:20.973 --> 00:07:22.463
- Hey.
- What?

00:07:22.508 --> 00:07:25.477
I haven't seen you around before.
Who are you with?

00:07:25.511 --> 00:07:28.969
That doesn't matter, does it?
I've got business with Tokko!

00:07:29.816 --> 00:07:30.805
Come with me for a second.

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.681
What's with you? Let go!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.847
Think about where you are.

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:38.755
Don't just go around yelling
about monsters or the Tokko.

00:07:40.259 --> 00:07:43.160
I'm Tadokoro
from the Akasaka S.M.I.F.

00:07:43.196 --> 00:07:45.323
I'm Shindo
from the Shibuya S.M.I.F.

00:07:45.364 --> 00:07:46.695
Shibuya, huh?

00:07:48.134 --> 00:07:51.262
By the time we got here,
it was all over.

00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:54.569
Damn it.
It's always this way.

00:07:54.607 --> 00:07:56.905
But the guys from the Tokko
just make me sick!

00:07:56.943 --> 00:07:58.911
Although it looks like they had
a bit of a tough fight

00:07:58.945 --> 00:08:00.003
on their hands this time.

00:08:00.046 --> 00:08:01.035
What?

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.481
Look, there's a hole here, too.

00:08:04.517 --> 00:08:07.850
This means that there were
at least two monsters.

00:08:13.926 --> 00:08:18.863
Jeez... even if I want to meet them,
I can't get the timing right.

00:08:23.102 --> 00:08:24.933
Who are you guys?

00:08:24.971 --> 00:08:26.370
That doesn't matter.

00:08:26.405 --> 00:08:29.169
Sorry, but I don't have any money.

00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:31.802
And my monthly salary is crap.

00:08:31.844 --> 00:08:33.402
You're Ranmaru Shindo, right?

00:08:33.446 --> 00:08:36.381
Huh, so you know my name.

00:08:36.415 --> 00:08:39.680
Then you know
that I'm a cop, right?

00:08:39.719 --> 00:08:41.550
Back off of this case.

00:08:41.587 --> 00:08:42.918
This case?

00:08:42.955 --> 00:08:45.048
Are you guys
from the Security Section?

00:08:45.091 --> 00:08:46.820
Looks like you're not.

00:08:46.859 --> 00:08:48.793
So who are you?

00:08:48.828 --> 00:08:52.594
It doesn't look like
you're with the monsters, either.

00:08:52.632 --> 00:08:54.566
They don't use guns, after all.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:57.865
It would be easy enough
to kill you right here, right now.

00:08:57.904 --> 00:09:00.839
But we'll give you a chance.
Back off.

00:09:00.873 --> 00:09:03.569
You know, I have no idea
what you mean when you say that.

00:09:05.578 --> 00:09:07.102
You'll regret this.

00:09:17.723 --> 00:09:19.190
What? You were attacked?

00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:21.489
Actually, it's more like
I was threatened.

00:09:21.527 --> 00:09:22.687
What do you mean by that?

00:09:22.728 --> 00:09:25.458
I'm telling you, I don't know.

00:09:25.498 --> 00:09:28.092
It's not like I have any secrets.

00:09:28.134 --> 00:09:29.999
But I don't know why
they would threaten me.

00:09:30.036 --> 00:09:31.025
Big brother!

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.004
W-What?

00:09:33.039 --> 00:09:35.030
From now on, you mustn't
go out for walks...

00:09:35.074 --> 00:09:36.564
...in the middle of the night,
no matter what!

00:09:36.609 --> 00:09:39.077
Umm... I'm not a kid, you know.

00:09:39.111 --> 00:09:40.100
Big brother!

00:09:40.146 --> 00:09:43.081
Before, when you ran out of here
by yourself...

00:09:43.115 --> 00:09:44.946
...with that scary look
on your face...

00:09:44.984 --> 00:09:47.646
How much did you think I worried?

00:09:47.687 --> 00:09:50.315
Oh, then...

00:09:50.356 --> 00:09:51.789
That time, I didn't have a choice.

00:09:51.824 --> 00:09:54.418
Please never do that again!

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:55.927
I'm sorry.

00:09:55.962 --> 00:09:57.759
This is absolute!

00:09:57.797 --> 00:09:59.628
I understand.

00:09:59.665 --> 00:10:01.326
Hey, big brother...

00:10:01.367 --> 00:10:03.028
What is it?

00:10:03.069 --> 00:10:05.902
Big brother...
is there a girl that you like?

00:10:05.938 --> 00:10:07.906
Err... what?

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:12.274
It's all right if you do.

00:10:14.146 --> 00:10:16.376
Is it the girl we ran into
at the hospital?

00:10:17.249 --> 00:10:18.841
So it is her!

00:10:18.884 --> 00:10:20.374
N-No!

00:10:20.419 --> 00:10:23.911
T-That was someone I met during
an investigation, that's all.

00:10:23.956 --> 00:10:26.186
Then is it that beautiful woman
who was wearing glasses?

00:10:26.225 --> 00:10:27.283
What?

00:10:27.326 --> 00:10:29.760
Or is it the lieutenant
with the long hair?

00:10:29.795 --> 00:10:31.695
What are you talking about?

00:10:31.731 --> 00:10:33.722
There are rumors about it
at the precinct!

00:10:33.766 --> 00:10:34.892
Rumors?

00:10:34.934 --> 00:10:39.496
"Recently, Detective Shindo is
always with a beautiful woman."

00:10:39.538 --> 00:10:42.006
That would be Hanazono's work.

00:10:42.041 --> 00:10:44.566
Next time,
be sure to introduce us.

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:47.636
I need to check to see
if she's right for you or not!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:49.511
Hey now...

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:54.942
Oh yeah, senior Yukino called
earlier about the recent case.

00:10:54.987 --> 00:10:58.923
She said she had something
she wanted to talk to you about.

00:10:58.958 --> 00:11:00.084
A call from Yukino?

00:11:00.126 --> 00:11:01.718
She says that she's gotten
a lot better...

00:11:01.761 --> 00:11:03.888
...and should be discharged soon.

00:11:03.929 --> 00:11:06.727
I see... that's good.

00:11:06.766 --> 00:11:09.735
Hey, what are your intentions
with senior Yukino?

00:11:09.769 --> 00:11:12.602
That's not important.
What did she say?

00:11:12.638 --> 00:11:15.607
It is important!
This is really important!

00:11:15.641 --> 00:11:16.801
Saya!

00:11:16.842 --> 00:11:20.278
Ohh! You always try to cover
things up so quickly.

00:11:20.312 --> 00:11:23.509
Um, she asked about
the 108 parts.

00:11:23.549 --> 00:11:25.949
The 108 parts.

00:11:25.985 --> 00:11:27.976
She didn't go into detail,

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:29.988
but she said that you would
understand when I told you.

00:11:30.022 --> 00:11:34.118
Oh yeah.
Senior Yukino is incredible.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.388
She's in the same class
as a deputy inspector...

00:11:35.428 --> 00:11:36.725
...from the Metropolitan Police
Department.

00:11:36.762 --> 00:11:38.286
Hey, are you listening?

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:43.597
Her name is Ryouko Ibuki.
Isn't that cool?

00:11:43.636 --> 00:11:45.763
Inspector Ibuki?

00:11:46.739 --> 00:11:48.639
I'd like to see Inspector Ibuki.

00:11:48.674 --> 00:11:50.574
You again?

00:11:50.609 --> 00:11:52.372
Do you have an appointment?

00:11:52.411 --> 00:11:53.469
No, I don't.

00:11:53.512 --> 00:11:56.276
Then there's no way.
Get one then come back.

00:11:56.315 --> 00:11:58.545
What did you say?
Are you making fun of me?

00:11:58.584 --> 00:12:01.417
Hey! I'll arrest you for interfering
with an officer of the law!

00:12:01.454 --> 00:12:04.423
That's what I was going to say!
Let me see her already!

00:12:04.457 --> 00:12:05.446
Shindo?

00:12:06.459 --> 00:12:07.926
Inspector Ibuki!

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:10.690
What are you doing here?

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.163
I wanted to see you.

00:12:12.198 --> 00:12:14.029
There was something
I just had to ask...

00:12:25.377 --> 00:12:27.937
I'm sorry to be bothering you.

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:29.447
That's fine.

00:12:30.382 --> 00:12:32.316
But what is it you want
with me?

00:12:32.351 --> 00:12:35.184
Well, you see, a while ago
I met up with Kureha...

00:12:35.221 --> 00:12:37.781
I mean Lieutenant Suzuka.

00:12:37.823 --> 00:12:40.018
You learned about
everything, right?

00:12:40.059 --> 00:12:42.823
I also heard about you,
Inspector Ibuki.

00:12:42.862 --> 00:12:46.059
I was told that you came
and asked about me the other day.

00:12:46.098 --> 00:12:48.032
Could that have been
because of...

00:12:48.067 --> 00:12:49.227
That's right.

00:12:49.268 --> 00:12:53.364
I wanted to see if you had any desire
to join the second division.

00:12:53.405 --> 00:12:55.066
That's what I thought.

00:12:55.107 --> 00:12:56.734
But that doesn't matter now.

00:12:56.776 --> 00:12:57.765
What?

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:59.505
Because it's done.

00:12:59.545 --> 00:13:02.776
It's done?
What do you mean?

00:13:02.815 --> 00:13:05.340
I mean that you mustn't join
the second division

00:13:05.384 --> 00:13:06.749
the way you are right now.

00:13:07.953 --> 00:13:10.148
You know what I'm saying, yes?

00:13:11.791 --> 00:13:15.625
You mean that I have to awaken
the phantom inside of me, right?

00:13:15.661 --> 00:13:18.494
Right. That condition
is absolute.

00:13:18.531 --> 00:13:19.759
To me, at least.

00:13:21.033 --> 00:13:22.295
Is that because you're afraid

00:13:22.334 --> 00:13:24.859
that the phantom might
take over my mind?

00:13:26.105 --> 00:13:28.073
But I've made my decision!

00:13:28.107 --> 00:13:33.010
If I can kill them by being
awakened, then I won't regret it!

00:13:33.045 --> 00:13:35.036
That's what I've lived for
up until now!

00:13:36.582 --> 00:13:39.016
You're just as I expected
you would be...

00:13:39.051 --> 00:13:40.609
one who rushes head-on...

00:13:40.653 --> 00:13:42.143
...no matter how many times
you're stopped.

00:13:42.188 --> 00:13:43.985
You're kind of like Kureha's
younger brother.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:47.584
Did you hear about
what happened to him?

00:13:47.626 --> 00:13:49.184
Huh? You can't mean...

00:13:49.228 --> 00:13:51.025
I killed him.

00:13:54.233 --> 00:13:57.327
If you end up that way...

00:14:05.644 --> 00:14:07.578
So that's Ranmaru Shindo?

00:14:07.613 --> 00:14:10.912
Yes. It looks like he finally
has come to a decision,

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.111
but this time
we're sending him off.

00:14:13.152 --> 00:14:15.643
So it seems. But...

00:14:15.688 --> 00:14:17.019
Yes?

00:14:17.056 --> 00:14:21.789
Well, it just seems like you're
giving up on him without any fuss.

00:14:21.827 --> 00:14:23.556
I'm just a little surprised.

00:14:23.596 --> 00:14:25.359
You're giving me too much credit.

00:14:25.397 --> 00:14:27.092
If you say so.

00:14:33.739 --> 00:14:37.266
Oh no!
Our break's going to end!

00:14:41.547 --> 00:14:43.845
Saya! We've got to hurry!

00:14:43.883 --> 00:14:45.214
I know!

00:15:13.145 --> 00:15:14.305
Saya.

00:15:16.415 --> 00:15:18.280
I heard it was a hit-and-run.

00:15:18.317 --> 00:15:20.911
No! That wasn't a hit-and-run!

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:23.879
I saw it from up close.

00:15:23.923 --> 00:15:27.552
That car ran a red light
and then it sped right for her.

00:15:27.593 --> 00:15:28.582
What did you say!?

00:15:28.627 --> 00:15:30.492
This was on purpose?

00:15:30.529 --> 00:15:32.360
I can't imagine that it wasn't!

00:15:34.066 --> 00:15:35.556
Why Saya?

00:15:36.602 --> 00:15:38.069
Back off.

00:15:38.103 --> 00:15:40.571
You'll regret this.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.539
Big brother.

00:15:54.186 --> 00:15:55.983
S-Saya!

00:15:56.021 --> 00:15:58.046
Have you been here
the whole time?

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:01.355
Are you all right?

00:16:01.393 --> 00:16:02.758
I'm all right.

00:16:03.963 --> 00:16:05.362
You worry too much.

00:16:05.397 --> 00:16:07.991
But you're all beaten up
and bruised.

00:16:08.033 --> 00:16:10.160
You worry too much.

00:16:10.202 --> 00:16:12.329
See, I can move it just fine.

00:16:12.371 --> 00:16:15.863
I've... always had this feeling...

00:16:15.908 --> 00:16:18.240
...that I've been protected
by something.

00:16:21.146 --> 00:16:23.614
That's why I was fine
this time, too.

00:16:40.599 --> 00:16:42.226
So you came after all.

00:16:43.635 --> 00:16:44.624
Inspector Ibuki.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:46.729
Heya, Shindo!

00:16:49.308 --> 00:16:51.276
Rokujo.

00:16:51.310 --> 00:16:55.212
Shindo, I heard about
your younger sister.

00:16:55.247 --> 00:16:56.908
Don't worry.

00:16:56.949 --> 00:16:59.747
From now on,
we'll be watching over her.

00:16:59.785 --> 00:17:02.276
Who attacked Saya?

00:17:02.321 --> 00:17:05.051
More than likely it was the guys
from the Society.

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:06.250
The Society?

00:17:06.291 --> 00:17:08.782
Yes. A group of people...

00:17:08.827 --> 00:17:11.159
...that would sell even their souls
to achieve their goals.

00:17:11.196 --> 00:17:14.859
You probably don't know
about this yet, Shindo...

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:18.267
...but there are a lot of different
groups that coexist in this world.

00:17:18.303 --> 00:17:22.069
A group that has sold their souls
to the phantoms, just as Kureha said.

00:17:22.107 --> 00:17:24.667
A group that is trying to use
the phantoms.

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:25.904
And us.

00:17:25.944 --> 00:17:28.003
Oh, don't get us wrong.

00:17:28.047 --> 00:17:31.414
The phantoms that coexist with us
are pretty much our allies.

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:33.645
From the other side's point of view,
they're traitors.

00:17:34.653 --> 00:17:35.677
Do you remember?

00:17:35.721 --> 00:17:37.746
The first time you were attacked...

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:40.258
...they said that they were
going to kill the traitors.

00:17:40.292 --> 00:17:43.591
Well, I guess you could say
that we're angels.

00:17:43.629 --> 00:17:47.690
But we won't know
if the phantom inside of me...

00:17:47.733 --> 00:17:49.496
...is an angel or a devil
until we awaken it.

00:17:50.536 --> 00:17:52.265
So I guess this means
that you're ready, then.

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.831
There's one more thing
I need to tell you.

00:17:57.876 --> 00:17:59.969
It's vital.

00:18:00.012 --> 00:18:02.071
Please tell me.

00:18:02.114 --> 00:18:04.582
You know about
the 108 parts, right?

00:18:04.616 --> 00:18:08.074
Yes. The ones that the phantoms
are each carrying.

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.883
That's not all.

00:18:13.425 --> 00:18:15.620
Damn it, at a time like this.

00:18:47.259 --> 00:18:49.227
So it can regenerate.

00:18:49.261 --> 00:18:51.593
It'll be troublesome if this one
becomes Number Fourteen.

00:18:56.201 --> 00:18:57.634
Rokujo!

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:00.262
Are you okay, Rokujo?

00:19:02.407 --> 00:19:03.533
Run away, quickly.

00:19:03.575 --> 00:19:06.339
There's no way I could do that!
I'm going to fight, too!

00:19:06.378 --> 00:19:07.367
You can't.

00:19:09.448 --> 00:19:11.575
You can't let them
get back to the gate!

00:19:11.617 --> 00:19:12.606
I know!

00:19:12.651 --> 00:19:14.516
What do you mean?

00:19:14.553 --> 00:19:17.113
Those are effectively
worker ants.

00:19:17.156 --> 00:19:20.284
When a phantom eats a human
and gains their power...

00:19:20.325 --> 00:19:21.883
...and returns to their "gate",

00:19:21.927 --> 00:19:24.293
that power makes
the "gate" larger...

00:19:24.329 --> 00:19:26.661
...and the speed
of collapse increases.

00:19:26.698 --> 00:19:30.293
And if it continues to increase...

00:19:30.335 --> 00:19:34.738
After two years, the human world
will be completely sucked in.

00:19:44.583 --> 00:19:46.448
Shindo!

00:19:46.485 --> 00:19:47.850
Rokujo!

00:19:55.961 --> 00:19:58.429
What should I do?

00:19:58.463 --> 00:20:00.624
We have no choice.

00:20:00.666 --> 00:20:01.928
Kureha!

00:20:01.967 --> 00:20:04.458
Shindo, are you ready?

00:20:04.503 --> 00:20:06.562
Do whatever it takes,
but hurry up and do something!

00:20:06.605 --> 00:20:08.004
- Wait!
- Sakura!

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:09.029
We still haven't told him!

00:20:13.278 --> 00:20:14.677
Kureha, hurry!

00:20:14.713 --> 00:20:17.238
Okay, then, let's give it a try.

00:20:17.282 --> 00:20:18.510
Close your eyes.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:19.915
- What?
- Hurry!

00:20:21.019 --> 00:20:22.316
Like this?

00:20:29.928 --> 00:20:32.226
Okay, then. Do your best.

00:20:32.264 --> 00:20:34.198
Try not to get eaten!

00:20:40.439 --> 00:20:43.237
This can't be happening.

00:20:45.244 --> 00:20:46.871
I'm bleeding.

00:20:47.946 --> 00:20:49.880
Am I going to die?

00:20:50.849 --> 00:20:52.714
Wasn't this supposed to awaken
the phantom sleeping inside of me?

00:20:53.685 --> 00:20:58.645
This is a ceremony
to awaken them.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:03.559
It plunges your soul into darkness
to call them forth.

00:21:03.595 --> 00:21:04.926
Call them forth?

00:21:04.963 --> 00:21:08.956
That's right. It's to awaken
their defensive instincts.

00:21:09.001 --> 00:21:12.493
To entice them into the darkness
in your heart.

00:21:12.537 --> 00:21:14.471
Entice?

00:21:14.506 --> 00:21:16.497
They desire darkness.

00:21:16.541 --> 00:21:18.975
Darkness?

00:21:19.011 --> 00:21:23.448
The rest is up to you,
whether it eats you or you eat it.

00:21:23.482 --> 00:21:27.316
Eat? What do you mean?

00:21:27.352 --> 00:21:28.842
What am I supposed to eat?

00:21:37.663 --> 00:21:39.927
Shindo.

00:21:44.369 --> 00:21:48.567
Well, it looks like his symbiosis
with it has gone off all right.

00:21:49.708 --> 00:21:52.199
Kya... Kyaviger...

00:22:09.695 --> 00:22:11.390
Shindo!

00:22:16.234 --> 00:22:18.964
He was sheltering
quite a powerful soul, wasn't he?

00:22:19.004 --> 00:22:22.440
It's possible that his is even more
powerful than Sakura's.

00:22:40.592 --> 00:22:45.359
Sono te wo tsunaidari

00:22:45.397 --> 00:22:50.334
Kuchizuke attari

00:22:50.369 --> 00:22:55.136
Ato sukoshi de sotto

00:22:55.173 --> 00:23:00.042
Saigo no hi ni naru

