Sherry, far away

00:23:49.361 --> 00:23:51.829
Sherry, far away

00:23:51.863 --> 00:23:58.894
I know you can find
my melodies

00:23:59.938 --> 00:24:02.908
Next Episode Preview

00:24:02.908 --> 00:24:04.876
Next Episode Preview
A predestined truth.

00:24:06.011 --> 00:24:08.673
This is not diplomacy.

00:24:08.713 --> 00:24:10.010
It's war!

00:24:11.183 --> 00:24:14.118
There's no going back now.

00:24:16.188 --> 00:24:19.123
On the next episode of Tokko:

00:24:20.892 --> 00:24:22.018
Brave.

